#define HELP_STRING "Controls/options:\n\t*File:\n\t\t-Ctrl-O: Open a comics file (PDF, CBR, CBZ ...)\n\t\t-Ctrl-Q: Quit (preferences will be saved)\n\n\t*Fullscreen:\n\t\t-Ctrl-F: Fullscreen mode on/off\n\n\t*Reading mode:\n\t\t-P: Switch to Page mode: only the full pages are displayed\n\t\t-S: Switch to Strip mode: display in strips mode, based on window/page width\n\t\t-C: Switch to Panel (square) mode: display each panel of the comics individually\nwhen possible\n\t\t-Page preview: Display a preview of the full page when in Panel/Strip mode,\nallowing to preview the whole page before reading in details\n\t\t-Ctrl-T: Show/hide the page thumbnails view (full page view on the side)\n\n\t*Navigation:\n\t\t-Left arrow: Go to previous case/previous strip (to previous page in Page mode)\n\t\t-Right arrow: Go to next case/next strip (to next page in Page mode)\n\t\t-Bottom arrow: Go to previous page\n\t\t-Top arrow: Go to next page\n\t\t-Mouse wheel up: Go to previous case/strip/page\n\t\t-Mouse wheel down: Go to next case/strip/page\n\n"
#define HELP_STRING_HTML "<H1><FONT COLOR=#8A0808>Menus (<I>shortcuts</I>):</FONT></H1><BR><H5><FONT COLOR=#8A0808>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*File:</FONT></H5><BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Open file</B></U> (<I>Ctrl-O</I>): Open a comics file (PDF, CBR, CBZ ...)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Open folder</B></U> (<I>Ctrl-Shift-O</I>): Open a folder of images (JPG, BMP, PNG ...). A folder should contain at least two images to be considered as a valid comics. <BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Export</B></U> (<I>Ctrl-E</I>): Export the current comics file as a folder of images (beta)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Quit</B></U> (<I>Ctrl-Q</I>): Quit (preferences will be saved)<BR><BR><H5><FONT COLOR=#8A0808>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*View:</FONT></H5><BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Fullscreen</B></U> (<I>Ctrl-F</I>): Fullscreen mode on/off (<I>Esc</I> to exit)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Thumbnails</B></U> (<I>Ctrl-T</I>): Show/hide the pages thumbnails view (full pages view on the side)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Maximal zoom</B></U>: Impose a maximal zoom value in any display mode. Select None for no maximum or 100% for no zooming at a greater size than the original image.<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Show panel in context</B></U> (<I>Ctrl-I</I>): Show the current panel in its context (i.e. the page) or isolated and centered. (Panel mode only)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Show panel border</B></U> (<I>Ctrl-B</I>): Activate/deactivate the border around the current panel when In Context. (Panel mode only)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Additionnal zoom</B></U> (<I>+/-</I>): Set the additionnal zoom value for panel mode: x1.0 adjust the size of the panel to it's optimal size, values lower than 1.0 display some extra context around the panel, values greater than 1.0 cause a zoom centered on the panel. (Panel mode only)<BR><BR><H5><FONT COLOR=#8A0808>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*Reading modes:</FONT></H5><BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Page</B></U> (<I>P</I>): Switch to Page mode: only the full pages are displayed (no Panel detection is done)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Strip</B></U> (<I>S</I>): Switch to Strip mode: the page display is optimised for the window width (no detection is done)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Panel</B></U> (<I>C</I>): Switch to Panel (square) mode: display each panel of the comics individually when possible (A detection is done on each page: can be slow with some comics.)<BR><BR><H5><FONT COLOR=#8A0808>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*Navigation:</FONT></H5><BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Page preview</B></U> (<I>Ctrl-P</I>): Display a preview of the full page when in Panel/Strip mode, allowing to preview the whole page before reading in details<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Previous</B></U> (<I>Left</I>): Go to previous case/previous strip (to previous page in Page mode)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Next</B></U> (<I>Right</I>): Go to next case/next strip (to next page in Page mode)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Previous page</B></U> (<I>Up</I>): Go to previous page<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Next page</B></U> (<I>Down</I>): Go to next page<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Mouse wheel UP</B></U>: On the document view: go to previous case/strip/page. On the thumbnails view: go to previous page.<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Mouse wheel DOWN</B></U>: On the document view: go to next case/strip/page. On the thumbnails view: go to next page.<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>First page</B></U> (<I>Home</I>): Go to first page of the comics<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Last page</B></U> (<I>End</I>): Go to last page of the comics<BR><BR><H5><FONT COLOR=#8A0808>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*Preferences:</FONT></H5><BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Use global preferences</B></U>: use the same preferences (Reading mode, Thumbnails view...) for all the documents<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U><B>Use documents preferences</B></U>: use different preferences (Reading mode, Thumbnails view...) for each document. Global preferences (most recent) will be applied to any new document open.<BR><BR>"
